<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line" lang="en">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Squeeze the Soaked Sponge: 
<br class="ltx_break">Efficient Off-policy Reinforcement Finetuning 
<br class="ltx_break">for Large Language Model</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
