            <span id="alg0.l4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;"># Stage 1: Mix-policy Proximal PG Training</span><span id="alg0.l4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
